1Sa 5:1 , The Philistines having brought the ark into Ashdod, set it in the house of Dagon;
1Sa 5:3 , Dagon is smitten down and cut in pieces, and they of Ashdod smitten with emerods;
1Sa 5:8 , So God deals with them of Gath, when it was brought thither;
1Sa 5:10 , and so with them of Ekron, when it was brought thither.
